        "biography": "Robert Mackenzie is an Australian supervising sound editor.\n\nHe is best known for his work on Animal Kingdom (2010), The Hunter (2011), Lore (2012), Felony (2013), The Grandmaster (2013), The Rover (2014), Deadline Gallipoli (2015), Partisan (2015), Lion, and the critically acclaimed war-drama film Hacksaw Ridge, for which he received two Academy Award nominations at the 89th Academy Awards, Best Sound Editing and Best Sound Mixing (both shared with Andy Wright).\n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Robert Mackenzie (sound engineer), licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia.",
